// A build description that excludes 2,000 files of a C library by platform, all in one function (one call the
// interpreter runs, as factorio-in-kpp's cLibraries is): it runs within a build description's budget (Interpreter.cpp,
// ConstBudget: 32 million steps over build() and describe() together), where until 2026-11-08 one constant
// evaluation's million steps stopped it (factorio-in-kpp's build.kpp then had room for 30 to 40 more exclude lines).
// run_tests' runbuild check (tests\inline.cmd) describes it with the real projectlib and settings.kpp.
